{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">圈中出名的「廿四孝爸爸」洪永城（Tony）平時工作幾忙都好，一有時間就會爭取時間陪伴一對前世情人！近日 Tony 抽空陪細女（阿妹）去街放電，問到阿妹最想去邊度時，囡囡竟然話要搭「叮叮」（電車），還極具霸氣爆出一句金句：「I want to see everything🤣」。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"guruhung_1790240870_3993152179640404330_428808748.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ipkbAAeRAq1790320363.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"guruhung_1790240870_3993152179640404330_428808748.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">聽到阿妹年紀細細就話要「睇晒全世界」，真係完美遺傳了爸爸這位旅遊節目主持的探索精神。面對囡囡可愛的要求，Tony 當然父愛氾濫，盡量滿足愛女心願，帶她搭叮叮欣賞港島風景。相中見到阿妹乖巧坐在電車的木椅上，眼仔睩睩極度精靈可愛。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"guruhung_1790240870_3993152196618996384_428808748.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UUhAOzioYI1790320364.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"guruhung_1790240870_3993152196618996384_428808748.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"guruhung_1790240870_3993152200964158525_428808748.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026XaJyKdkiFa1790320364.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"guruhung_1790240870_3993152200964158525_428808748.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">兩父女在車程中瘋狂自拍大玩表情包，Tony 又在鏡頭前擘大個口搞怪，而阿妹則在旁邊嘟起嘴仔，反差萌十足。另一張相兩父女還對着鏡頭一起神同步伸脷賣萌，表情十足十餅印一樣！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-25 上午11.10.42.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026urwti7ULxu1790320364.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-25 上午11.10.42.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T04:58:14.036657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}